et folder count cache'=>'重置文件夹计数缓存','Wipe all settings (folders, attachment relations)'=>'擦除所有设置（文件夹、附件关系）','Reset the order of all galleries'=>'重置所有画廊的顺序','RealMediaLibrary:Reset'=>'RealMediaLibrary：重置','Load RML functionality in frontend'=>'在前端加载 RML 功能','RealMediaLibrary:General'=>'RealMediaLibrary：常规','Subfolders offer you the possibility to bring more structure into your media library. They help you to keep the overview, even if you really have many files in your media library.'=>'子文件夹使您可以将更多结构带入媒体库。即使您的媒体库中确实有很多文件，它们也可以帮助您保持概览。','Full order control?'=>'全部排序控制？','Want to create subfolders?'=>'想要创建子文件夹吗？','Custom content order?'=>'自定义内容顺序？','You like collections?'=>'你喜欢收藏吗？','No, not interested...'=>'不，不感兴趣...','Continue without any support and without e.g. discount announcements'=>'在没有任何支持和没有例如的情况下继续折扣公告','Continue without regular updates and without any support'=>'无需定期更新且无需任何支持即可继续','Activate free license & Continue'=>'激活免费许可证并继续','Activate license & continue'=>'激活许可证并继续','Get your free license'=>'获取免费许可证','License activation'=>'许可证激活','Before we start organizing your media, you can *obtain your free license to enjoy all the benefits* of the free version of Real Media Library. Get started now!'=>'在我们开始整理您的媒体之前，您可以*获取免费许可证以享受 Real Media Library 免费版本的所有好处*。现在就开始！','Start to reorder the files / images by *title, filename, ID, ...*'=>'开始按*标题、文件名、ID、...* 对文件/图像重新排序','Copying one file...'=>'复制一个文件...','Copying {count} files...'=>'正在复制 {count} 个文件...','Moving one file...'=>'移动一个文件...','Moving {count} files...'=>'正在移动 {count} 个文件...','Apply automatic order...'=>'应用自动排序...','Apply order once...'=>'应用一次排序...','Reset order'=>'重置排序','Order content by *{name}*...'=>'按 *{name}* 排序内容...','Receiving data...'=>'正在接收数据...','Product license not for production use!'=>'产品许可证不可用于生产用途！','{count} files remaining...'=>'剩余 {count} 个文件...','Reorder subfolders of *{name}*...'=>'重新排序 *{name}* 的子文件夹...','Reordering the tree hierarchy...'=>'重新排序树层次结构...','Deleting *{name}*...'=>'正在删除 *{name